= Awards & Grants
== Research grants

- *2020--2022* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Applying a distributed training model for resource
  allocation in edge caching networks" (DS2020-28-01), VNU-HCM. Budget: 500 million VND.
- *2016--2018* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Resource management optimization in cache-enabled
  mobile networks" (102.02-2015.36), Nafosted. Budget: 460 million VND.
- *2015--2016* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Optimizing the content placement in caching
  networks supporting adaptive bit-rate streaming" (C2015-28-01), VNU-HCM.
  Budget: 50 million VND.
- *2013--2015* \M *Key member*, "Performance improvement of multipath TCP congestion control
  algorithms" (102.02-2013.48), Nafosted. Budget: 584 million VND.

== Awards and honours

- *2018* \M Outstanding Scientific Publication Award for Individual, academic year 2017--2018,
  VNU-HCM.
- *1996* \M Third prize, National Mechanical Olympic Competition (Hydraulics).

== Patent

- "Method for managing width of window in multi-path TCP," Korean Intellectual Property Office
  (KIPO).

